WEBVTT

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.700
Hoi! Joso! Ketsu!

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.690
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:13.500
Stop missing the small fry!

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.730
A little brat like you is going
to protect Karasumori?

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:19.580
Don't make me laugh, brat!

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:22.350
Shut up! Don't call me a brat!

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:24.320
My name is Sumimura Yoshimori!
I'm a Kekkaishi!

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:26.620
Now that's funny!

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:30.490
Obtaining the power of
Karasumori will be easy!

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.170
You have to do more than dodge!

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:41.100
Hurry up and seal it with the Kekkai.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.340
I would if I could!

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:50.180
Hoi! Joso!

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:52.070
Ketsu.

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:59.510
No fair. Tokine! He was mine!

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:03.220
Oh? I think it's your fault
for taking too long.

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:07.730
Yoshi, you've got to be speedy
in a challenge!

00:01:09.530 --> 00:01:10.520
I can't take this anymore!

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:17.900
Screw this!
I risk danger every single night!

00:01:18.210 --> 00:01:21.640
And I get nothing
out of a job like this!

00:01:23.210 --> 00:01:24.770
Are you going to run away
from your duty?

00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:28.550
Making a kid work at night
has to be against Child...

00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:30.450
Child La... anyway, it must be illegal!

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:32.140
What are you talking about?

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:34.020
Fearing the light and favoring the night,

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:35.650
the Ayakashi are dwellers
of the darkness.

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:37.650
As hunters of the Ayakashi,

00:01:37.690 --> 00:01:39.130
the Kekkaishi must also live
in the same world.

00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:42.160
The laws of human society
do not apply to you!

00:01:42.730 --> 00:01:43.930
I'll kill you all!

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:45.730
Ketsu!

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:47.260
Metsu!

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:48.670
Tenketsu!

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:55.700
Whoa! That freaked me out!

00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:58.840
Yoshimori... you're...

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:02.650
He lacks accuracy

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:06.080
but his raw power and agility
are astonishing.

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:11.950
When he fully matures
he just may become...

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:19.600
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:02:19.600 --> 00:02:21.470
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:26.680
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:28.580
(Fighting late into the night)

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:32.010
Drive away all hesitation

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:36.420
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:39.960
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:43.290
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:48.960
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:53.460
Sha la la la la...

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:59.880
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:01.840
(Secret romance)

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:07.050
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:08.810
(A strange distance)

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:15.660
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:16.730
Yeah

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:20.200
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:23.970
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:29.130
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:54.460
What the-

00:03:54.730 --> 00:03:57.130
What are you doing, Grandpa?!

00:03:57.470 --> 00:04:01.160
Maintain your concentration
or your Kekkai will disperse!

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:03.870
Shut up! Stop trying to bother me
while I'm training!

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:07.580
I heard from Madarao that
you brought down an Ayakashi.

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:11.240
Job well done! However...

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:13.180
The Hazama Style Kekkai Technique is

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:15.310
the essence of simplicity and fortitude.

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:16.820
Utility and effectiveness over all else.

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:19.220
We take pride in effectiveness!

00:04:19.350 --> 00:04:22.380
Now, what do you do
when you find an Ayakashi?

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:24.650
Use Hoi to designate my target.

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:25.930
And then?

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:27.790
Use Joso to designate the location.

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:29.460
And to capture the Ayakashi?

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:31.260
Use Ketsu to create a Kekkai.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:32.700
And what do you do
after you capture it?

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:36.230
If it isn't dangerous,
I let it go with Kai.

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:39.140
If it's dangerous,
I vaporize it with Metsu.

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:40.640
And after that?

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.680
Use Tenketsu to open the door
to the Other World

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:45.650
so that it doesn't regenerate.

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:47.850
Well done!

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:49.280
Listen carefully.

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:52.120
Defending the Karasumori Site
is the family profession.

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:55.920
You must remember that!
Now go train!

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:59.890
Why do I have to take over
the family profession?

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:08.230
By the way, I found this
inside your school bag.

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:11.200
This "School Survey"
for third grade, class four.

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:16.670
"Favorite Subject: Art Class."
"Favorite School Food: Coffee Milk."

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:22.310
"Best Summer Vacation: Lighting fireworks
with a friend from my neighborhood."

00:05:22.350 --> 00:05:24.750
But you don't have time to play
at night, do you?

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:31.350
Don't tell me that this "friend"
of yours is that Yukimura girl.

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:36.790
Ow!

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:44.640
You fool! How dare you play
with that Yukimura!

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:47.140
When will you realize that

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:50.110
you are the legitimate heir
to this family?

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:52.680
I never agreed to that.

00:05:53.010 --> 00:05:54.910
You fool!

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:59.550
No matter what you say,
the Hoin Mark appeared on you.

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:02.150
It is proof that you are
the legitimate heir

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:05.350
to the Hazama Style Kekkai Techniques.

00:06:06.190 --> 00:06:08.630
And since you have the Hoin Mark,
you have no choice!

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:10.730
What do you mean by that?

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:13.760
I wish my brother was the one
with this Hoin Mark.

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:18.060
Don't talk about Masamori...

00:06:18.970 --> 00:06:19.740
But-

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:22.540
I said shut it!

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:24.910
Legitimate Heir Chop!

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:33.210
I can't take this life anymore.

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:34.480
You're crying again.

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:37.160
Tokine?

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:40.150
If you hate it so much,
why don't you just quit?

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:42.290
Shut up! I'm not crying!

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:43.930
You were whining too.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.130
No. I wasn't!

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:47.140
Stop acting like you're better than me
just because you're older!

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:50.930
Well. It's not like I care
if you cry or not.

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:54.040
What about you?

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:57.580
Aren't you sick of having
to train every day?

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:01.750
I take pride in my work.

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:06.050
If Masamori-san had been the heir.

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:08.280
He would never have
complained like this, and-

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:09.220
He's got nothing to do with this!

00:07:10.590 --> 00:07:11.960
Don't talk about my brother!

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:16.860
Here she comes again!

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:18.300
Tokine!

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:21.100
How dare you speak to
a man of the Sumimura clan?!

00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:22.460
Grandma?

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:26.040
The Sumimura clan is nothing
but an illegitimate sect that

00:07:26.070 --> 00:07:30.580
came to existence because our founder.
Master Hazama Tokimori.

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:33.810
Did not have any children.

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:37.740
The Yukimura clan.
Master Tokimori's best student.

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:41.980
Is the only legitimate successor
to the Hazama Style.

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:45.080
I don't care who
the legitimate whatever is!

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:47.560
What are you doing, Yoshimori?!

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:51.990
How dare you have such
a friendly chat with a Yukimura!

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:54.520
Does it look like
we're having a friendly chat?!

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:57.370
Oh my. Fighting within the family?

00:07:57.410 --> 00:08:00.640
I suppose it's only natural for a clan
that's nothing but an accessory.

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:03.710
An accessory?! How dare you!

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:06.980
The Sumimura clan is
the true legitimate successor

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:09.640
of the Hazama Style
chosen by the founder himself!

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:13.150
This Hoin Mark is proof of that!

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:14.680
Shut your mouth!

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:17.260
The Yukimura clan is
the true legitimate successor!

00:08:17.290 --> 00:08:19.820
This Hoin Mark is proof of that!

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:23.030
Cover yourself, you hag!
It's an eyesore!

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:24.530
How rude!

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:28.960
We'll settle this once and for all!

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:31.570
Very well! I welcome the challenge!

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:44.210
I can't take this anymore.
Stop them, Tokine!

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:48.050
It's no use.

00:08:50.360 --> 00:08:52.330
That was truly regrettable.

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:55.690
If Shuji-san hadn't called
us in for dinner...

00:08:55.730 --> 00:08:59.030
I could have ended
this 400-year rivalry.

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:00.700
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:05.240
Toshimori, didn't you read
the letter from your mother?

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:07.200
You have to eat your bell peppers.

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:10.240
How about just one?

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:12.140
Sure, but you'll have to eat two next time.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:13.210
Okay!

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:16.280
Yoshimori, go to bed early
if you're tired.

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:19.490
I'll come wake you up tonight.

00:09:19.650 --> 00:09:20.420
Okay...

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:24.320
Shuji-san, would you please
stop spoiling him like that?

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:27.090
Yes. But Yoshimori is still a child.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:29.060
He may be a child,

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:31.090
but if he's to take over
the family profession...

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:33.470
Hey! Straighten up!

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:37.800
This is pitiful!

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:40.500
It's that very attitude that prevents
you from improving your techniques.

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:43.910
You'll never beat
that Yukimura girl at this rate!

00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:48.350
I-I can't help it!
She's older than me!

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:52.180
That's no excuse!
It's because you don't train enough!

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:55.890
No! It's because you're a terrible teacher!

00:09:55.920 --> 00:09:59.160
Why, you! You ignore your own
inexperience and blame me?!

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:07.000
Father? Yoshimori?

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:09.500
It's an Ayakashi.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:10.900
Can you tell?

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:12.510
A little.

00:10:13.510 --> 00:10:16.170
I guess you're a child
of a Kekkaishi. After all.

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:19.270
It'll be a while before
I go out there though.

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:26.860
The Karasumori family that ruled this land

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:29.220
was said to be a clan possessing

00:10:29.220 --> 00:10:31.160
abnormally high levels of spiritual energy.

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:33.860
Because of that, many Ayakashi and

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:36.520
other eerie phenomena harassed them.

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:41.300
They called for a specialist in
the ways of the Ayakashi.

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:45.300
That was the founder. Hazama Tokimori.

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:47.780
After that,

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:51.010
he served as the official Kekkaishi
of the Karasumori clan.

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:55.350
But the Karasumori clan accumulated
more spiritual energy

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:57.650
as generations passed.

00:10:57.790 --> 00:10:59.850
The Ayakashi that came near them

00:10:59.850 --> 00:11:01.620
absorbed that power, evolved,

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:03.920
and started to attack other people.

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:07.720
At one point, due to overwork and illness,

00:11:07.760 --> 00:11:11.250
the Kekkaishi was unable to work
for three consecutive days.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:15.290
On the morning of the fourth day,
the Kekkaishi went on duty

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:19.000
and found that the evil spirits within
the castle had grown to tremendous sizes.

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:22.970
There were no human survivors.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:26.810
That was the end of the Karasumori clan.

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:30.850
The soul, the source of power
to the Karasumori clan.

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:33.680
Is now enshrined under the former castle.

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:37.160
Asleep, deep beneath
what is now a school.

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:42.300
However, their power is still here.

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:44.460
If it is left alone.
It will attract the Ayakashi again,

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:47.020
empowering them and bringing
danger to those around.

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:50.410
And that place...

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:53.140
is the Karasumori Academy.

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:03.910
Tokine!

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:06.580
Oh? So you're here.

00:12:06.690 --> 00:12:09.050
You really take your time,
don't you, Yoshi?

00:12:09.420 --> 00:12:11.820
Come on.
Am I not allowed to come here?

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:14.290
I didn't say that. But still...

00:12:14.930 --> 00:12:18.300
You always have that sulky look
on your face.

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:24.430
Did you know that the Ayakashi
are attracted to the gloomy ones?

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:28.330
Then again,
I guess it'll be better for me that way.

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:31.640
Anyway, if you can't put
your whole heart into it,

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:32.740
I'd rather you not come.

00:12:33.180 --> 00:12:34.150
You'll just get in the way.

00:12:36.220 --> 00:12:39.910
What was that?
Who does she think she is?!

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:46.650
What's up with that!
It's not like I asked to do this!

00:12:48.460 --> 00:12:51.160
Is she going to make fun of me too?

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:55.600
Oh my. Is he crying?

00:12:56.640 --> 00:12:58.040
When did it become like this?

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:01.470
It wasn't like this
before I started training...

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:04.610
You can jump this far can't you?

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:06.010
But...

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:09.610
It's okay you can do it! Come on.

00:13:11.590 --> 00:13:12.610
Okay...

00:13:16.390 --> 00:13:17.420
SLIP!

00:13:20.930 --> 00:13:22.660
Here don't cry.

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:28.360
I'm sorry.

00:13:29.340 --> 00:13:30.830
I'm... kay...

00:13:32.810 --> 00:13:34.040
I'm... okay...

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:42.240
Yoshimori I'm going to say that

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:44.950
I was playing near the river alone
and fell in.

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:46.980
You should say the same.

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:48.550
Why?

00:13:49.020 --> 00:13:53.020
Because... your family
and mine don't get along.

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:54.460
Why?

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:57.530
I don't really know.

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:04.100
We can't be friends like
we used to anymore?

00:14:09.510 --> 00:14:10.980
Looks like our target is here.

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:12.670
Let's go!

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:14.150
Y-Yeah!

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:19.620
I'll find the target for you,
so you better do it right.

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:23.720
What? You make it sound like
I'm the one who's holding us back!

00:14:23.930 --> 00:14:25.790
Well it is. Isn't it?

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:30.530
Compared to her inexperienced dog,
my sense of smell is much better.

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:33.830
I always find the target first,

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:36.860
but they come in from the side
and take it away every time.

00:14:37.070 --> 00:14:39.470
Shut up! They're just playing dirty!

00:14:42.010 --> 00:14:42.940
Is this the place?

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:44.410
Yes. I'm sure of it.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:47.240
Well, I guess I feel
something eerie here...

00:14:48.350 --> 00:14:51.610
What, you don't believe me?
How rude.

00:14:52.650 --> 00:14:53.990
It's really close.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:58.590
Are you sure?
Maybe it's in the pond.

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:00.660
Stop that!

00:15:00.760 --> 00:15:02.460
Hey! There it is, Yoshimori!

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:03.590
All right!

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:07.030
Come back here!

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:11.070
I said come back here!

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:16.240
Where did it hide?

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:19.340
Yoshimori, listen quietly.

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:22.550
Do you see that tall tree to
the right of the flowerbed?

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:25.540
Can you enclose the entire tree?

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:27.020
Yeah!

00:15:27.890 --> 00:15:30.980
It's a bit large
but I'm sure he can do it.

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:33.660
Hoi! Joso!

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:35.390
Ketsu!

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:39.460
All right! I caught it!

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:53.140
Come on, what are you doing?

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:55.880
That's a full-fledged Ayakashi you have.
Hurry up and destroy it!

00:15:55.880 --> 00:15:57.480
I-I know!

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:02.580
Um...

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:06.890
I'm sorry, I...

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:11.590
I heard my wounds would
heal faster if I came here.

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:15.060
But I'll leave right away.

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:16.540
So please...

00:16:17.140 --> 00:16:20.200
I'm sorry. It's my job.

00:16:24.680 --> 00:16:25.200
Hey!

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:29.050
I understand. It's all right.

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:33.390
I'd just be eaten if I went back.

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:36.790
It's because I'm weak.

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:44.890
This place is so mysterious.
It's filled with so much power.

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:50.600
I feel that if I stay here...
I'll become stronger too.

00:16:51.210 --> 00:16:53.800
But it's enough...

00:16:56.510 --> 00:16:57.080
I...

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:59.240
I got enough!

00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:01.740
It transformed!

00:17:17.730 --> 00:17:20.360
It transformed because you took your time!

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:27.440
To think that a kid like you
is a Kekkaishi.

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:28.810
You don't take us seriously, do you?

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:31.170
But I must thank you.

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:36.140
I only needed a little time.

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:37.680
See ya!

00:17:44.530 --> 00:17:45.220
Tokine!

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:46.020
Joso!

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:47.490
Ketsu!

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:54.160
Metsu!

00:17:58.110 --> 00:17:58.970
Tenketsu!

00:18:05.010 --> 00:18:06.540
Tokine, you're bleeding...

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:09.380
You still don't understand
this land we're standing on!

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:14.450
They start out weak, but with time,
they can become strong and brutal!

00:18:14.890 --> 00:18:17.520
They'll do anything to buy time!

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:22.190
You can't give them any mercy!
Remember that!

00:18:27.200 --> 00:18:29.600
Tokine! Tokine!

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:31.260
Tokine!

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:34.210
Open up! Please!

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:35.810
- What is it?
- Open up!

00:18:35.810 --> 00:18:37.300
- Do you know what time it is?!
- Open up!

00:18:39.580 --> 00:18:41.780
Tokine is... Tokine is...

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:44.110
What's wrong? Oh my!

00:18:44.950 --> 00:18:47.110
Shizue-san! Hurry up and
prepare the medicine!

00:18:47.220 --> 00:18:47.920
Right away!

00:18:48.620 --> 00:18:50.220
What's going to happen to Tokine?!

00:18:50.420 --> 00:18:53.090
She won't move!
She'll be okay, right?!

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:54.720
She won't die, right?!

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:55.820
Be quiet!

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:59.100
I thank you for bringing her
back here.

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:03.230
But we'll take care of the rest.
You should go home.

00:19:03.300 --> 00:19:06.900
But it's my fault! Let me help!

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:10.670
I said go home!
There is nothing you can do here!

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:24.290
You'll get in the way if
you stay there long.

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:26.690
Um... How is Tokine?

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:29.460
We have no need for the Sumimura.

00:19:29.900 --> 00:19:30.760
Go home.

00:19:39.870 --> 00:19:43.070
I talked a little with
the missus next door.

00:19:43.340 --> 00:19:48.780
She'll live...
but her fever isn't going down.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:52.540
That Ayakashi probably had
some sort of poison.

00:19:52.890 --> 00:19:54.790
I hope she gets well soon.

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:04.690
It's not your fault, Yoshimori.

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:07.230
It'll be all right. She'll get better soon.

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:09.760
It is my fault...

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:14.240
It is my fault!

00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:20.710
FIVE YEARS LATER

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:43.970
Oh. Come on.
Why didn't you call me?

00:20:44.270 --> 00:20:46.800
Shut up, ghost dog.
Go rest in peace already.

00:20:47.480 --> 00:20:49.910
You're annoying as always.

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:55.480
- There!
- Let's get it!

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:57.140
Hoi! Joso!

00:20:58.450 --> 00:20:59.040
Ketsu!

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:01.760
All right! I did it!

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:03.090
What the-?!

00:21:07.190 --> 00:21:09.130
Nice roll. Yoshi!

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:10.630
What was that for. Tokine?!

00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:13.730
You need to watch your feet.

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:17.000
The way you fight is just too careless.

00:21:18.740 --> 00:21:21.370
And what's with
this humongous Kekkai?

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:24.200
Listen and be amazed!

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:25.580
It's the fruits of my training!

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:29.020
But this is your target.

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:30.710
Do you want me to lend you
a magnifying glass?

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:34.010
Why are you wasting your strength
on a target this small?

00:21:34.320 --> 00:21:38.990
Haven't you heard the saying?
"A lion boils a rabbit with full force!"

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:41.000
The actual saying goes
something like,

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:44.800
"A lion hunts even a rabbit
with all its strength."

00:21:45.170 --> 00:21:45.720
Huh?

00:21:46.330 --> 00:21:48.230
You need to pace yourself
when using your powers.

00:21:48.840 --> 00:21:52.140
What if a huge one comes
at you right after?

00:21:52.310 --> 00:21:55.540
Shut up! I'll deal with that then.

00:21:55.640 --> 00:21:57.870
No matter what comes at me.
I'll take care of it!

00:21:58.010 --> 00:22:00.310
There you go again,
saying things you don't mean.

00:22:00.720 --> 00:22:01.610
Let's go, Hakubi.

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:03.280
Sure thing, honey.

00:22:03.750 --> 00:22:04.550
Wait!

00:22:04.990 --> 00:22:06.420
Just do your best.

00:22:11.030 --> 00:22:12.250
I meant everything I said.

00:22:13.530 --> 00:22:17.760
I don't want others to be hurt
while I just cry on the sidelines...

00:22:17.870 --> 00:22:19.990
I don't want that to happen ever again!

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:25.600
That's why I...

00:22:31.380 --> 00:22:33.780
I will become stronger!

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:47.130
The breeze blows past us
in this city we know so well

00:22:47.130 --> 00:22:53.830
The two of us both walk at our usual pace

00:22:55.400 --> 00:23:03.210
Joking around I noticed after I laughed

00:23:03.210 --> 00:23:09.550
Your mature look that
I had never seen before

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:19.390
You don't have to say anything it's okay

00:23:20.690 --> 00:23:25.760
I'm not mistaking these feelings

00:23:27.330 --> 00:23:34.840
Straight ahead I'm pushing forward

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:42.370
Yet I can't help but keep gazing at you

00:23:44.120 --> 00:23:51.360
Even if we are near or far

00:23:51.360 --> 00:23:59.930
The red string connects one to another
